# Response Intelligence Upgrade (Non-Negotiable)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-response-intelligence-upgrade.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-response-intelligence-upgrade.md)

## This is NOT a UI copy task

Upgrade the **transformation layer**: Care Reality Model → caregiver response.  
Do not add features. Do not redesign the app. Do not ship ChatGPT summaries.

## SolenOS is

Living Care Record · Events → Relationships → Understanding → Confidence  

## SolenOS is not

Chatbot · summarizer · notes app · task manager · medical answer engine  

## Enforce in code

`src/lib/response-acceptance-gate` must **reject** output that:

- Summarizes / echoes without understanding  
- Exposes internal jargon (care signal, memory anchor, confidence score, …)  
- Empathy scripts / false certainty / diagnosis / generic advice / task-ifying  
- Fakes continuity when no memory · ignores history when memory exists  

## Required feel

*“How this fits the bigger care story”* — never *“The AI analyzed my message.”*

## Final test

Can months of use reconstruct evolution + decisions + uncertainty? If no → incomplete.
